1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:09,654
设备巡检维修系统上线后，设备主管周师傅在同一个项目里提了个新任务。
After the equipment system goes live, equipment lead Zhou adds a new task to the same project.

2
00:00:09,804 --> 00:00:15,266
他不会写代码，就用大白话写下排障经验，交给智能体开发。
He can't code, so he writes his know-how in plain words for the Agent Builder.

3
00:00:15,418 --> 00:00:22,152
这次交付的是一个智能体：角色设定写好了，还通过 MCP 接上了刚上线的系统。
This time it delivers an agent: role written, and connected via MCP to the new system.

4
00:00:22,302 --> 00:00:27,908
周师傅再把排障手册作为附件上传，变成智能体的内置知识。
Zhou uploads his troubleshooting manual as built-in knowledge.

5
00:00:28,059 --> 00:00:32,417
测试通过后，周师傅点提交，确认上架审核。
Tests passed, Zhou clicks Submit and confirms it for listing review.

6
00:00:32,641 --> 00:00:38,607
设备部的维修工程师陈志远，在工作里选上诊断助手，直接提问。
Maintenance engineer Chen picks the assistant in Work and just asks.

7
00:00:38,757 --> 00:00:44,915
它从系统里查到这台设备的维修记录，再按老师傅的经验给出排查步骤。
It pulls the machine's repair records, then gives steps from the master's experience.

8
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:49,473
Build，让非专业开发人员都可构建自己的智能体。
Build lets non-developers build their own agents.
